# Version control
.git
**/.git

# Installed dependencies (installed inside the image)
**/node_modules

# Build output and caches (regenerated inside the image)
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/coverage
.analysis

# Local environment and secrets
**/.env
**/.hub
**/.rocks
**/.aws
**/.vscode
**/.husky

# Repo metadata and docs that the image build does not need
**/.github
**/.editorconfig
**/README.md
**/LICENSE
**/npm-debug.log
**/Dockerfile*
